    <title>Node.js lifecycle support</title>
    <meta name="maintainer" content="lkucharczyk@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
  </info>
  <para>Prior to the LTSS phase, up to three upstream major versions of <literal>nodejs</literal> are supported concurrently per Service Pack. During the LTSS phase, only the latest available version is supported.</para>
